# Google Maps Platform API Key (NEVER commit real keys or .env files)
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# How to get a free, zero-billing Maps Demo Key for prototyping:
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required).
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
# 4. Generate and copy your demo key, then paste it above in a local `.env` file.
#
# For production deployments:
# - Create a restricted key in Google Cloud Console:
#   https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# - Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, and Geocoding API.
# - Restrict the key by HTTP referrer and designated APIs:
#   https://developers.google.com/maps/api-security-best-practices?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
